  - m_Id: 3842468506472448
    m_Localized: You can equip and use consumable items from the inventory. Once
      equipped, they can be used directly during the game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4209804719656960
    m_Localized: EXTRACTION SYSTEM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4209961536294912
    m_Localized: During your journey, you must seek the hidden <u><color=#C9A64B>Extraction
      Points</color></u>. The first time you find them, you must awaken their <u><color=#C9A64B>magic</color></u>.
      Once awakened, they shall remain bound to their <u><color=#C9A64B>creator</color></u>,
      and you may use them whenever needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
